** {{IPA|en|/pəˈsɛn.taɪl/|a=UK}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Rho9998-percentile.wav|a=UK}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛntaɪl}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|statistics}} Any of the ninety-nine [[point]]s that divide an [[ordered]] [[distribution]] into one hundred parts, each containing one [[per cent]] of the [[population]].
# {{lb|en|statistics}} Any one of the hundred groups so divided.
#: {{ux|en|She is highly intelligent—she has an IQ in the top '''percentile'''.}}

====Usage notes====
When comparing performance, a higher percentile is better; to be in the "90th percentile" is to have performed better than 90% of the rest of the group.

